{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id848213522"}, "name":{"label":"idibnjiokmb"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-02-27T17:15:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"9662751586"}, "title":{"label":"OverLapping Tasks"}, "content":{"label":"I love this app and use it daily HOWEVER, i find myself needing to quickly add another task into my already full day. Hence why i encounter overlapping  tasks frequently.\n\nThere is NO button to quickly push everything down to make space for the new task so you have to manually go through and change all the times on each task (This takes way too long).... Please Please Please add a function to quickly move all task down to allow sapce for the new task. \n\nOnce this is added the app will be perfect :)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
