{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id471134328"}, "name":{"label":"fixyourappls"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-11-13T14:58:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.5.5"}, "id":{"label":"9286894647"}, "title":{"label":"So far I love the app"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve just downloaded this yesterday after downloading and looking at a couple of other planner apps.\nThe layout of this one is perfect and I paid for the $12 a year for everything straight away. That is very affordable and a no brainer price for me.\nI didn’t want to add another monthly subscription bill to use a daily planner.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id395979562"}, "name":{"label":"Professors Monkey"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-11-10T16:20:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.5.4"}, "id":{"label":"9276267501"}, "title":{"label":"So close to perfect!!! But…"}, "content":{"label":"Firstly, I’ve got ADHD and the layout for the app is amazing! \nPros:\n- the layout and customisation even with the free version is very versatile and the paid version is cheap compared to other apps/services.\n- adding sub tasks, notes and daily tasks they you may not get to is a breath of fresh air. There’s enough features to satisfy 95% of people but without be overwhelming. I picked it up within 15 minutes.\n\nShould be added:\n- A way to see the structure of your week instead of just 1 day ‘day by day’, flicking through.\n\nDEFINITE ADD ON!\n- if you set out an entire day with lots of tasks, it would help to have a feature were if you are behind schedule, you can select a ‘push back’\nOption for all or selected tasks. \nExample: pressing ‘push back’ moved all my tasks today forward by (35+mins), meaning I don’t have edit, move, order, etc… every single task on that day. Would save a tremendous amount of time and energy \n\nCONCLUSION:\n- This app is already amazing and structured in a way that would help anyone out but especially individuals like myself! With minor changes and updates (like mentions and probably more), it wouldn’t have any flaws.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id737927669"}, "name":{"label":"—Sam—2025"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-11-09T19:26:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.5.4"}, "id":{"label":"9273324580"}, "title":{"label":"Stopped working completely after the last update"}, "content":{"label":"The app keeps crashing after last update, doesn't sync at all, developer doesn't respond at all.  I can't even delete my account and create new one as the app doesn't let you to.  The app is a joke", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id791135720"}, "name":{"label":"M.Lisa13"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-11-08T12:50:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.5.4"}, "id":{"label":"9269197425"}, "title":{"label":"It’s NEARLY perfect"}, "content":{"label":"Such a great app. It’s simple to use and perfect for me to see how I’m using my time each day.\n\nThe only thing it really needs is a timer so you can press “start” and do a task then press “end” when you’re done. It’s too tricky to type in everything you do and spend time thinking back on what it is you’ve done that day.\n\nBeing able to start a timer would be much quicker and help me see where I’m using my time in REALtime rather than typing in how long I THINK it took me. Please please add this", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
